// On-screen context
"On-screen context" = "螢幕上下文";
"Use on-screen text as context" = "使用螢幕上的文字作為上下文";
"When you dictate into another app, VoiceDraft reads the text visible in that app's front window. Names and terms help recognition, and a short excerpt near your cursor helps the writing model. Nothing is saved or synced." = "當你向其他 App 口述時，VoiceDraft 會讀取該 App 最前方視窗中可見的文字。名稱和詞彙有助於辨識，游標附近的一小段摘錄則有助於寫作模型。不會儲存或同步任何內容。";
"Recognition hints" = "辨識提示";
"Sends up to 300 names and terms from the screen to your speech model. The full text is never sent to speech recognition." = "最多將螢幕上的 300 個名稱和詞彙傳送給你的語音模型。完整文字絕不會傳送給語音辨識。";
"Writing reference" = "寫作參考";
"Sends up to 1,500 characters near your cursor to your writing model so it can match names, terms and tone. It never adds this text to your result." = "最多將游標附近的 1,500 個字元傳送給你的寫作模型，以便對應名稱、詞彙和語氣。這些文字絕不會加入你的結果。";
"Read the window with OCR when an app exposes no text" = "App 未提供文字時用 OCR 讀取視窗";
"Some apps hide their text from Accessibility. VoiceDraft can capture only that window and recognize its text on this Mac. Requires Screen Recording. The image is never saved, and macOS may ask you to confirm this permission again from time to time." = "部分 App 不向輔助使用公開其文字。VoiceDraft 可以僅擷取該視窗，並在這台 Mac 上辨識其中的文字。需要「螢幕錄製」權限。影像絕不會被儲存，macOS 也可能不時請你再次確認此權限。";
"Screen Recording" = "螢幕錄製";
"Screen Recording (optional)" = "螢幕錄製（選用）";
"Only needed if you turn on reading windows with OCR in Settings." = "僅在你於設定中開啟用 OCR 讀取視窗時才需要。";
"Only the front window is captured, and only when an app exposes no text." = "僅擷取最前方的視窗，且僅在 App 未提供文字時擷取。";
"OCR is skipped until you allow it. Text from Accessibility still works. If you just allowed it, quit and reopen VoiceDraft." = "允許之前會略過 OCR，輔助使用提供的文字仍可使用。如果你剛剛允許了此權限，請結束並重新打開 VoiceDraft。";
"Allow Screen Recording" = "允許螢幕錄製";
"Screen Recording is allowed" = "已允許螢幕錄製";
"Screen Recording is not allowed" = "尚未允許螢幕錄製";
"Never read these apps" = "不讀取這些 App";
"Password managers and VoiceDraft are always skipped." = "密碼管理工具和 VoiceDraft 一律會被略過。";
"Built in" = "內建";
"App bundle ID, e.g. com.apple.mail" = "App 的 Bundle ID，例如 com.apple.mail";
"Exclude" = "排除";
"Running apps" = "正在執行的 App";
"On-screen text stays in memory for at most 60 seconds. It is never written to history, saved to disk or synced. Visible text can include other people's messages, so exclude apps you do not want read." = "螢幕上的文字最多在記憶體中保留 60 秒，絕不會寫入歷史記錄、儲存到磁碟或同步。可見文字可能包含他人的訊息，因此請排除你不希望被讀取的 App。";
"On-screen context · 1 term" = "螢幕上下文 · 1 個詞彙";
"On-screen context · %d terms" = "螢幕上下文 · %d 個詞彙";
"Extract words from this screen…" = "從目前螢幕擷取詞彙…";
