// Voice usage metrics
"Dictation time" = "聽寫時長";
"Dictated words" = "輸入字詞";
"Average speed" = "平均速度";
"Est. time saved" = "預估節省時間";
"Time in saved voice transcripts. Typed tests and empty transcripts are excluded." = "依儲存的語音轉錄時長統計，不包含文字測試和空轉錄。";
"Counts the original transcript, not generated answers. Chinese and Japanese characters count individually; other languages count words." = "統計原始轉錄，不計 AI 產生的回答。中文和日文按字計，其他語言按詞計。";
