"Estimated against typing 45 words per minute, minus dictation time. Processing and editing time are not measured." = "按每分鐘打字 45 個字詞估算，再減去聽寫時長；未計入處理和編輯耗時。";
"Share of dictated words matching your currently enabled vocabulary, including aliases. Overlapping matches count once. This is vocabulary coverage, not recognition accuracy; changing vocabulary updates past statistics." = "原始轉錄中符合目前啟用詞庫（含別名）的字詞比例，重疊命中只計一次。這表示詞庫覆蓋率，並非辨識準確率；修改詞庫會更新歷史統計。";
